  + "Audit against the formula spec doc: (1) RS = percentrank(close/SPY_close, 26/78/156) — check the windows and that it is price-ratio percentile, not excess return. "
  + "(2) Breakout 2B rule: close >= EMA10 >= EMA20 >= SMA50 AND close >= 20-bar high; basing |close-SMA50| < 1.0*ATR AND EMA spread <= 1.5*ATR; 4B mirror. Check EMA/SMA spans and the 20-bar lookback for off-by-one errors. "
  + "(3) xATR = ((close-SMA50)/SMA50)/(ATR/close) with tiers 7-11 / >=11 / < -7. "
  + "(4) ATR(14), ATR% = ATR/close*100. (5) McClellan 19/39 EMAs, 63-day z-scores. (6) VMR weights 0.35/0.25/0.25/0.15 and piecewise maps. (7) RAM weights 0.35/0.30/0.20/0.15, breadth risk = 50-22.5*z, target-risk formula. (8) Rotation 0.60/0.40 blends, R(a,b) = 100*EMA(RS,a)/EMA(EMA(RS,a),b), tanh acceleration bounded +/-0.10. "
