  + "For EACH replica module (Opportunity Ranker v2 incl. Breakout/Expansion/RS/ATR columns; Market Pulse + VIX Mood Ring + RAM; Theme leaderboard / rotation engine; Breadth engine) research and document: (a) what desk question it answers that the desk cannot answer today; (b) concrete touchpoints (e.g. ranker as a research watchlist prioritizer feeding the nightly strategist; pulse/RAM as an informational overlay on the desk terminal; breadth z-scores corroborating market_context regime reads; rotation quadrants informing sector posture in the nightly brief); (c) classification: ALLOWED under standing calibration/research authority, NEEDS-USER-APPROVAL (touches a hard rail), or RESEARCH-ONLY (informational, no behavior change); (d) data/refresh cadence needed and failure modes. "
